ームエンタテインメント","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:106536","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"磯谷 佳江","creatorId":"vndb:s9818","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9818","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9818","name":"磯谷 佳江","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:106537","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30137","characterName":"こはる","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30137"},"originalCharacterName":"こはる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A polite, cheerful young woman. Having lived by herself for most of her life, she often forgets her own name as it’s been so long since she’s heard it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In order to better assimilate with the others and not be disliked, she immersed herself in books about social etiquette and basic manners."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has the ability to control fire. She is the most powerful of all the espers in her group and takes great care to hide that fact from the others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The routes of Senri, Masamune, and Kakeru are only accessible when the player selects Koharu as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30137"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5bfc74c6ff912e26c28cc66bc7bbaa0e6cecdbd5dad3e6af39ebb81f1e93f958.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9eae70c8cf3357408aacd2ce113df183da8d85053a59690f74e3bf4ea2d70905.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤村 歩","creatorId":"vndb:s1703","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1703","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1703","name":"藤村 歩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57135","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30138","characterName":"久我 深琴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30138"},"originalCharacterName":"久我 深琴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"906"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful and mature young lady. Born into a wealthy family, she is responsible and dependable, but sometimes her nature can come across as bossy. She’s never talked to any males other than her childhood friend, so she is a bit uneasy living on the airship."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has the ability to create magical barriers. She was able to protect the temple as well as those important to her before the airship came. She was taught that her powers were bestowed by god, and is very proud of it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The routes of Itsuki, Sakuya, and Natsuhiko are only accessible when the player selects Mikoto as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f6a23609ca4889edda8b8c2b52aa6c86980442c705f26e43d4ef64f2fd36c9b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0e0d6a3c55275858e4a261d1b0b281e3ca85cc0d98ca416807e68a57bb9fd71.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高垣 彩陽","creatorId":"vndb:s1764","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1764","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1764","name":"高垣彩陽","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57133","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30139","characterName":"不知火 七海","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30139"},"originalCharacterName":"不知火 七海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"402"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young girl with a fragile, doll-like appearance, she is actually incredibly capable as she was born into a ninja clan, dating back to very old times. Her physical abilities are exceedingly high, and she's good at erasing her presence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She rarely expresses her feelings, making it difficult to read her emotions. She thinks much differently than those around her while at the same time able to find common ground."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has the ability to erase the memories of others, and has been ordered by her father to use that ability many times. She fears her powers and hates having them with all of her heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The routes of Ron, Heishi, and Akito are only accessible when the player selects Nanami as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30139"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e88c7b8ebcd0b76b6270b2eb1c6f8e9bf5619c4933f8b47187dde9796758faf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c3cbaf37cf64ccd0eb9ac8a20e5304093cfcd99456fddb1cfb817bddad8603e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瀬戸 麻沙美","creatorId":"vndb:s1433","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1433","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1433","name":"瀬戸 麻沙美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57132","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30140","characterName":"結賀 駆","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30140"},"originalCharacterName":"結賀 駆","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"725"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"176"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A good young man who's kind and cheerful. Quick-thinking, Kakeru uses a mix of his positiveness and individuality to bring the members together. Because of his cleverness, he has a manipulative and scheming side to him, so some people think he is a wicked, \"haraguro\" person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kakeru is a natural \"S (sadist)\", since he unintentionally and without any malice, corners people. His ability is to control greenery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His route is only accessible when the player selects Koharu as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of his official website profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30140"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7e35b4b75131370c6d9393844b50d8cccf306e15e0eb48049855fa3e7d81af03.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f1458144d4af3475ce010f61b1f13dbf62def1fa7e5f82d584e2e5ed15820ac.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶 裕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s84","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s84","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s84","name":"梶 裕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57119","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30141","characterName":"市ノ瀬 千里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30141"},"originalCharacterName":"市ノ瀬 千里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"222"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though he has a pretty face, Senri is negative and reticent young man. Since he was brought up being treated cruelly by the people around him, he is distrustful of people and is poor at social interaction."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This hasn't changed since going aboard the Norn, as Senri hardly uses the common room; preferring to remain closed up in his own room."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His route is only accessible when the player selects Koharu as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of his official website profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30141"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a87df05906d375974c7d7b2c5db663c28884e271c32a399f217c1af5bd749c73.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/6563dd97b9b3e19aa8a5cf54aa406f7bd87ebc3b22f7f097b91a057f960d4651.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"下野 紘","creatorId":"vndb:s70","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s70","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s70","name":"下野 紘","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57118","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30367","characterName":"遠矢 正宗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30367"},"originalCharacterName":"遠矢 正宗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"104"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"186"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A caring person, Masamune is like an older brother to the younger members. Though intelligent, he is awkward with his hands and is poor with his dealings. He often acts as a mediator in disputes, but finds himself wasting his time. Masamune is an avid reader, and has a wide range of knowledge. He usually wears gloves. Apparently, they have something to do with controlling his power."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His route is only accessible when the player selects Koharu as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of his official website profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30367"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dfa4345243458cb827c47204fae45bfb5e1b243bdf3fc4b8dba22e0a9a01c03a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d573ae563be72b216b64f19d3c6e31896edba821ce7d61621505b5dbf3c35d18.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐藤 拓也","creatorId":"vndb:s683","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s683","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s683","name":"佐藤 拓也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57130","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30368","characterName":"吾妻 夏彦","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30368"},"originalCharacterName":"吾妻 夏彦","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"22"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1011"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Natsuhiko possesses a cold way of thinking, and rarely raises his voice. For some reason, he is after the lives of the members with powers aboard the Norn. Good with mechanics, he's good at inventing things. He is also the ship's control specialist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His route is only accessible when the player selects Mikoto as the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translation of his official website profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30368"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f988dcdae2272a1d698ab52c4ccd68c1a4e6a91374d41e7d58225b7377871428.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da833b270d3970b6a